{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:25 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:25 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:25 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img alt=\"警員調查男子墮樓原因。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/1fc127e6666c31cf99644c5d30e0d3f7/2026-11/page_40.jpg\"/><p>長沙灣發生家居意外。今日（4日）下午1時44分，蘇屋邨百合樓一名男子在家中疑攀窗檢拾物件，突然從低層單位窗口墮下，跌落1樓平台受傷，街坊目睹經過連忙報警。救援人員到場，將事主救返地面，他清醒由救護車送院治理。</p><p>據悉墮樓男子年屆七旬，獨居於百合樓4樓一單位。事發時他正在檢拾物件，意外墮樓。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/06560be25f55ac6a8b2f32a3b035eb3f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_14_55_37_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d4afad3ba40cb4bbb1e350abd3d763bb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_14_55_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bacd843c23a2a5ea1356d4857a868f44/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_14_55_37.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/810ff633407de071efe6aeaf0e6e01e4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_14_55_38_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是百合樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c0e49b99aac9d2b8d4fbb918c7f9706e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_14_55_38_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男子由低層單位墮樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8cf3288e00c1f72b217c641b0188c0b3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_14_55_38.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bc53b40a56bb6457163f438ecc4cf287/2026-11/1_1_3.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/707a1c3bb16d28d5f9b18587879d8164/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-04_at_14_55_39.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:45:45.397969+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:47.592788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:50.179243+00:00","content_hash":"a5516f6e404a5a583731c516f